flowchart LR
    Human[Two-person human review] --> Offline[Offline Ed25519 signing]
    Offline --> Bundle[Read-only exact artifact bundle]
    Image[Image by sha256 digest] --> Controller
    Bundle --> Controller[Credential-free admission controller]
    Controller --> Ledger[(Durable anti-replay ledger)]
    Ledger --> Trading[Trading node]
    Ledger --> Sentinel[Independent safety sentinel]
    Bundle --> Trading
    Bundle --> Sentinel
    Trading --> Risk[Synchronous risk and capital clamp]
    Risk --> Nautilus[Nautilus Hyperliquid adapter]
    Nautilus --> Vault[Approved BTC mainnet account or vault]
    Sentinel --> Deadman[Dead-man renewal and cancel-all]
    Deadman --> Vault
    Trading --> Metrics[Prometheus and Grafana]
    Sentinel --> Metrics
    Vault --> Evidence[Canary evidence and drills]
    Evidence --> Awaiting[AWAITING_PRODUCTION_APPROVAL]
    Awaiting --> Human
    Operator[Operator rollback or revoke] --> Ledger
    Ledger -. inactive .-> Risk
    Ledger -. inactive .-> Deadman
